# HTML Report and Document Rule

When creating reports or documents in HTML, follow all rules below:

1. Load Tailwind CSS via CDN:
   - `<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>`
2. Use a modern, clean business design style.
3. Ensure responsive layout so mobile screens do not break.
4. Decorate charts and tables with Tailwind utility classes to keep them readable.
5. Deliver as a single self-contained HTML file that can be opened directly in a browser.

## Output Checklist

- Includes Tailwind CDN script in `<head>`
- Uses responsive containers, spacing, and typography (`sm`, `md`, `lg` breakpoints)
- Tables/charts are visually structured with borders, spacing, and readable colors
- Final result is one standalone `.html` file with no extra build steps
